{"text": "Noy has a new red kite. 'Look, Bella!' he says. The kite flies high in the blue sky. But the wind is very strong. Oh no! The kite is in the tree, and it is broken. Noy is very sad. 'Don't cry,' says Bella. At night, Bella fixes the kite with tape and paper stars. In the morning, Noy sees it. He is so happy! 'Thank you, Bella!' Now they fly the kite together. Brothers and sisters help each other.", "words": [[0.05, 0.4], [0.4, 0.74], [0.74, 0.86], [0.86, 1.2], [1.2, 1.55], [1.55, 2.12], [2.97, 3.49], [3.49, 4.09], [4.09, 4.26], [4.26, 4.69], [5.54, 5.84], [5.84, 6.23], [6.23, 6.72], [6.72, 7.12], [7.12, 7.31], [7.31, 7.61], [7.61, 8.0], [8.0, 8.4], [9.25, 9.49], [9.49, 9.73], [9.73, 10.05], [10.05, 10.21], [10.21, 10.53], [10.53, 11.09], [11.94, 12.31], [12.31, 12.85], [13.7, 13.98], [13.98, 14.35], [14.35, 14.54], [14.54, 14.72], [14.72, 15.0], [15.0, 15.46], [15.46, 15.74], [15.74, 15.93], [15.93, 16.11], [16.11, 16.76], [17.61, 18.08], [18.08, 18.4], [18.4, 19.02], [19.02, 19.65], [20.5, 21.09], [21.09, 21.58], [21.58, 21.98], [21.98, 22.56], [23.41, 23.58], [23.58, 24.08], [24.08, 24.5], [24.5, 24.91], [24.91, 25.16], [25.16, 25.49], [25.49, 25.83], [25.83, 26.16], [26.16, 26.41], [26.41, 26.82], [26.82, 27.32], [28.17, 28.36], [28.36, 28.64], [28.64, 29.39], [29.39, 29.67], [29.67, 30.04], [30.04, 30.32], [31.17, 31.44], [31.44, 31.71], [31.71, 31.98], [31.98, 32.79], [33.64, 34.03], [34.03, 34.28], [34.28, 34.73], [35.58, 35.85], [35.85, 36.2], [36.2, 36.47], [36.47, 36.73], [36.73, 37.08], [37.08, 37.87], [38.72, 39.144], [39.094, 39.144], [39.094, 39.144], [39.094, 39.144], [39.094, 39.144], [39.094, 39.144]], "tag": "chatterbox:sonia", "pace": "v2-slow", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}